{"id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-provable.md","title":"带证明系统参数的可证关系","display":"df-provable — 带证明系统参数的可证关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-provable","aliases":["20-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — 带证明系统参数的可证关系","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 的可证概念；本地证明系统签名","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — 带证明系统参数的可证关系"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 的可证概念；本地证明系统签名"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(\\mathrm{Ax}_P,\\mathrm{Rules}_P)\">\\(P=(\\mathrm{Ax}_P,\\mathrm{Rules}_P)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}_P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}_P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>。</p>\n<p>本目录默认 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=P_H\">\\(P=P_H\\)</span>，其公理和规则已在上游展开。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Der}_P(T,p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i&lt;|p|\\\n[p_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_P\\lor\n\\exists u\\in\\{p_j:j&lt;i\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ ((u,p_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_P)],\\\\\nT\\vdash_P\\phi\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\ [\\operatorname{Der}_P(T,p)\\land |p|&gt;0\\land p_{|p|-1}=\\phi].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Der}_P(T,p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i&lt;|p|\\\n[p_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_P\\lor\n\\exists u\\in\\{p_j:j&lt;i\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ ((u,p_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_P)],\\\\\nT\\vdash_P\\phi\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\ [\\operatorname{Der}_P(T,p)\\land |p|&gt;0\\land p_{|p|-1}=\\phi].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>P 是明确传入的形式结构，不能把任意规则集的证明关系当作逻辑真理。PA 相关原子采用固定的经典一阶带等号证明系统：命题重言式、全称实例及分配公理、等号反身与替换公理，规则为 modus ponens 与满足自由变量限制的 generalization。其有限公式、代入条件和规则实例均可有效检查；有效公理枚举配合枚举阶段见证给出 c.e. 可证句子集合。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 的可证概念；本地证明系统签名；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P=(\\mathrm{Ax}_P,\\mathrm{Rules}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rules}_P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)^{<\\omega}\\times\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"P=P_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Der}_P(T,p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall i<|p|\\\n[p_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_P\\lor\n\\exists u\\in\\{p_j:j<i\\}^{<\\omega}\\ ((u,p_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_P)],\\\\\nT\\vdash_P\\phi\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\ [\\operatorname{Der}_P(T,p)\\land |p|>0\\land p_{|p|-1}=\\phi].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2005,"backlinks":[{"id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。"},{"id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-provable]]。"},{"id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"}],"outgoing":["0c35680c0004f5e2","8372bbf882660759"]}